          "note": "Type 10: a square sprite, the texture scaled to r1 pixels (rows stepped like columns, so a square texture), top left corner at the vertex r0, opacity about r2 / 16. Its texels' transparency (top four bits) is read as clear for 0xF000 only, so soft shadows in a sprite come out solid.",
